{"unit_id":"myfire2014__dsh-admin-gateway#card-zh","repo":"myfire2014/dsh-admin-gateway","commit":"092a3bb3f96edfc20d9efa8ff27664e9dc9d8211","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-admin-gateway 是面向 DSH Web 的管理员登录网关插件（Web 客户端）：它启动独立 HTTP 服务，在登录后将浏览器请求代理到配置的 DSH Web 上游，并处理 WebSocket 升级连接。插件提供登录和登出页面、带有效期的会话、来源 Host 与 IP 配置、请求频率限制、普通 HTTP 与 SSE 请求转发，以及 WebSocket 连接代理。未登录访问页面会跳转到登录入口，API 请求返回未授权响应。网关和上游地址、密码来源及会话时长均可配置，适合需要通过独立入口访问 DSH Web 的部署；使用时需提供管理员密码，并配置 DSH Web 上游。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:31-60","index.js:272-323","index.js:356-426","index.js:428-549"]}
{"unit_id":"myfire2014__dsh-admin-gateway#card-en","repo":"myfire2014/dsh-admin-gateway","commit":"092a3bb3f96edfc20d9efa8ff27664e9dc9d8211","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-admin-gateway adds a separate password login gateway for DSH Web. It proxies authenticated HTTP, SSE, and WebSocket traffic to a configurable upstream. The listener, password source, session lifetime, and access lists can be configured. Requires an administrator password.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:31-60","index.js:272-323","index.js:356-426","index.js:428-549"]}
