{"unit_id":"myfire2014__dsh-admin-gateway#feature-1","repo":"myfire2014/dsh-admin-gateway","commit":"092a3bb3f96edfc20d9efa8ff27664e9dc9d8211","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-admin-gateway 的功能「网页登录」：网关提供登录与登出路由。用户提交管理员密码后获得带有效期的会话 Cookie；登出会删除当前会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:272-334"]}
{"unit_id":"myfire2014__dsh-admin-gateway#feature-2","repo":"myfire2014/dsh-admin-gateway","commit":"092a3bb3f96edfc20d9efa8ff27664e9dc9d8211","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-admin-gateway 的功能「HTTP 反向代理」：会话有效的请求会转发到配置的 DSH Web 上游，并将上游响应流回浏览器；上游连接失败时返回网关错误响应。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:356-389","index.js:513-515"]}
{"unit_id":"myfire2014__dsh-admin-gateway#feature-3","repo":"myfire2014/dsh-admin-gateway","commit":"092a3bb3f96edfc20d9efa8ff27664e9dc9d8211","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-admin-gateway 的功能「WebSocket 事件连接」：网关在通过会话检查后代理 HTTP Upgrade 连接，并双向转发升级后的数据流，供 DSH Web 事件连接使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:391-426","index.js:517-529"]}
{"unit_id":"myfire2014__dsh-admin-gateway#feature-4","repo":"myfire2014/dsh-admin-gateway","commit":"092a3bb3f96edfc20d9efa8ff27664e9dc9d8211","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-admin-gateway 的功能「网关访问规则」：可配置允许的 Host、IP 和每分钟请求上限，也可设置监听端口、地址、会话期限及请求上游。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:33-60","index.js:99-125","index.js:462-474"]}
{"unit_id":"myfire2014__dsh-admin-gateway#caveat-1","repo":"myfire2014/dsh-admin-gateway","commit":"092a3bb3f96edfc20d9efa8ff27664e9dc9d8211","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-admin-gateway 使用前须知：启动时必须提供管理员密码，可通过 DSH_ADMIN_PASSWORD 环境变量或 adminPassword 配置项设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:71-78"]}
{"unit_id":"myfire2014__dsh-admin-gateway#caveat-2","repo":"myfire2014/dsh-admin-gateway","commit":"092a3bb3f96edfc20d9efa8ff27664e9dc9d8211","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-admin-gateway 使用前须知：网关默认监听 127.0.0.1:3081，并将请求转发到 127.0.0.1:3080；部署时可配置监听地址、端口和上游。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:33-39","cordis.patch.yml:4-13"]}
